msgstr "&Vlastito"

#: kwview.cc:557
msgid "&Refresh All Variables"
msgstr "&Osvježi sve varijable"

#: kwview.cc:560
msgid "Update all variables to current values."
msgstr "Postavlja sve varijable na aktuelne vrijednosti."

#: kwview.cc:561
msgid ""
"Update all variables in the document to current values.<br><br>This will "
"update page numbers, dates or any other variables that need updating."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja sve varijable u dokumentu na njihove aktuelne vrijednosti.<br><br>Ovo "
"znači ispravljanje brojeva stranica, datuma ili nekih drugih varijabli čiju "
"vrijednost treba uskladiti sa aktuelnim stanjem."

#: kwview.cc:565
msgid "&Expression"
msgstr "&Izraz"

#: kwview.cc:569
msgid "Te&xt Frame"
msgstr "&Tekstualni okvir"

#: kwview.cc:572 kwview.cc:573
msgid "Create a new text frame."
msgstr "Napravi novi tekstualni okvir."

#: kwview.cc:576
msgid "P&icture..."
msgstr "&Slika..."

#: kwview.cc:580
msgid "Create a new frame for a picture."
msgstr "Napravi novi okvir za sliku."

#: kwview.cc:581
msgid "Create a new frame for a picture or diagram."
msgstr "Pravi novi okvir za sliku ili dijagram."

#: kwview.cc:584
msgid "For&mula"
msgstr "For&mula"

#: kwview.cc:587 kwview.cc:588
msgid "Insert a formula into a new frame."
msgstr "Ubaci formulu u novi okvir."

#: kwview.cc:590
msgid "&Table..."
msgstr "&Tabela..."

#: kwview.cc:594
msgid "Create a table."
msgstr "Napravi tabelu."

#: kwview.cc:595
msgid ""
"Create a table.<br><br>The table can either exist in a frame of its own or "
"inline."
msgstr ""
"Napravi tabelu.<br><br>Ova tabela se može nalaziti u okviru ili zasebno, "
"u liniji."

#: kwview.cc:597
msgid "&Object Frame"
msgstr "&Objektni okvir"

#: kwview.cc:601 kwview.cc:602
msgid "Insert an object into a new frame."
msgstr "Umetni objekat u novi okvir."

#: kwview.cc:604
msgid "Fi&le..."
msgstr "&Datoteka..."

#: kwview.cc:610
msgid "&Font..."
msgstr "&Font..."

#: kwview.cc:613
msgid "Change character size, font, boldface, italics, etc."
msgstr "Promjeni veličinu slova, font, debljinu, zakošenost itd."

#: kwview.cc:614
msgid "Change the attributes of the currently selected characters."
msgstr "Promjeni atribute trenutno izabranih znakova."

#: kwview.cc:616
msgid "&Paragraph..."
msgstr "&Odlomak..."

#: kwview.cc:619
msgid "Change paragraph margins, text flow, borders, bullets, numbering, etc."
msgstr "Promjeni margine odlomka, tok teksta, rubove, nabrajanja itd."

#: kwview.cc:620
msgid ""
"Change paragraph margins, text flow, borders, bullets, numbering, "
"etc.<p>Select text in multiple paragraphs to change the formatting of all "
"selected paragraphs.<p>If no text is selected, the paragraph where the "
"cursor is located will be changed."
msgstr ""
"Mijenja margine odlomka, tok teksta, rubove, nabrajanja itd.<p>Izaberite "
"tekst u nekoliko odlomaka da biste izmjenili formatiranje svih tih "
"odlomaka.<p>Ako nije izabran tekst, biće izmjenjen odlomak u kojem se "
"trenutno nalazi kursor."

#: kwview.cc:622
msgid "F&rame/Frameset..."
msgstr "&Okvir/frameset..."

#: kwview.cc:625
msgid "Alter frameset properties."
msgstr "Izmjeni osobine frameseta."

#: kwview.cc:626
msgid "Alter frameset properties.<p>Currently you can change the frame background."
msgstr "Izmjeni osobine frameseta.<p>Trenutno možete izmjeniti pozadinu okvira."

#: kwview.cc:628
msgid "P&age..."
msgstr "S&tranica..."

#: kwview.cc:631
msgid "Change properties of entire page."
msgstr "Izmjeni svojstva cijele stranice."

#: kwview.cc:632
msgid ""
"Change properties of the entire page.<p>Currently you can change paper size, "
"paper orientation, header and footer sizes, and column settings."
msgstr ""
"Izmjeni svojstva cijele stranice.<p>Trenutno možete mijenjati dimenzije "
"papira, orijentaciju, veličinu zaglavlja i podnožja i postavke kolona."

#: kwview.cc:635
msgid "&Frame Style Manager..."
msgstr "&Upravitelj stila okvira..."

#: kwview.cc:638
msgid "Change attributes of framestyles."
msgstr "Izmjeni atribute stila okvira."

#: kwview.cc:639
msgid ""
"Change background and borders of framestyles.<p>Multiple framestyles can be "
"changed using the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Izmjeni pozadinu i rubove stila okvira.<p>Koristeći ovaj dijalog "
"možete promjeniti više stilova."

#: kwview.cc:642
msgid "&Style Manager..."
msgstr "&Upravitelj stilova..."

#: kwview.cc:645
msgid "Change attributes of styles."
msgstr "Izmjeni atribute stilova."

#: kwview.cc:646
msgid ""
"Change font and paragraph attributes of styles.<p>Multiple styles can be "
"changed using the dialog box."
msgstr ""
"Izmjeni atribute fonta i odlomka za stilove.<p>Koristeći ovaj dijalog možete "
"izmjeniti više stilova."

#: kwview.cc:653
msgid "Increase Font Size"
msgstr "Povećaj font"

#: kwview.cc:654
msgid "Decrease Font Size"
msgstr "Smanji font"

#: kwview.cc:656
